    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d963">

                <pb facs="0849" n="733" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg733"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/24278a.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                            Ambassador of Brazil</hi>.<anchor n="35"
                        xml:id="d963-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-08-09">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 9, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My dear Mr. Ambassador</hi>: I enclose for your
                    information copies of the communication<anchor n="36" xml:id="d963-f2"/> to the
                    chiefs of the factions in Mexico, such as the Conference agreed upon at its last
                        meeting.<anchor n="37" xml:id="d963-f3"/> As you will recall, it is proposed
                    to send this communication to a number of influential persons in Mexico, a
                    preliminary list of which was prepared by Ambassador Suárez and is being
                    considered by me with a view to ascertaining whether any names could be added. *
                    * *</p>
                <p>I am [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert Lansing.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d963-f1" n="35" type="source" xml:id="d963-f1-content">
                <p>The same to the other conferees.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d963-f2" n="36" xml:id="d963-f2-content">
                <p>Not printed; it was revised at the meeting of August 11. See the telegram of
                    August 13, 6 p.m., to Mr. Parker.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d963-f3" n="37" xml:id="d963-f3-content">
                <p>The meeting of August 5 (see the Secretary’s July 29).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
